#: memory.cpp:204
msgid "Physical Memory"
msgstr "Fizika memoro:"

#: memory.cpp:205
msgid ""
"This graph gives you an overview of the <b>usage of physical memory</b> in "
"your system."
"<p>Most operating systems (including Linux) will use as much of the "
"available physical memory as possible as disk cache, to speed up the system "
"performance. "
"<p>This means that if you have a small amount of <b>Free Physical Memory</b>"
" and a large amount of <b>Disk Cache Memory</b>, your system is well "
"configured."
msgstr ""

